---
layout: null
permalink: /capstone/projects.json
sitemap: false
---
{%- comment -%}
Machine-readable list of capstone projects, generated from the capstone posts
themselves so it cannot drift from what /capstone/ shows.

A project is a post whose url is under /capstone/ but is not the index itself.
Consumed by the Spring backend (scripts/sync_capstones.py) to keep its
capstone_project rows in step, and by /mentor to render a mentor's assigned
projects. The slug is the identity everything else keys off.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign projects = site.posts | where_exp: "p", "p.url contains '/capstone/'" -%}
[
{%- assign first = true -%}
{%- for p in projects -%}
  {%- if p.url != '/capstone/' and p.type != 'documentation' -%}
    {%- assign slug = p.url | remove_first: '/capstone/' | remove: '/' -%}
    {%- if slug != '' -%}
      {%- if first == false -%},{%- endif -%}
      {%- assign first = false -%}
  {"slug": {{ slug | jsonify }}, "title": {{ p.title | default: slug | jsonify }}, "url": {{ p.url | jsonify }}, "description": {{ p.description | default: "" | strip | jsonify }}}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor %}
]
